{{!
    @template local_unifiedgrader/help

    Unified Grader help page. One page in four parts (teachers, students,
    administrators, developers) with a section navigation beside it.

    The grader's help button links to #integration-{modname}, so the ids
    integration-assign, integration-forum, integration-quiz and
    integration-bigbluebuttonbn must stay. Every id the page had before the
    3.0 rewrite is kept as well, so older links still land.

    Context variables:
    * wwwroot - string - Moodle root URL.
    * pluginrelease - string - Plugin release (e.g. "3.0.0").
    * pluginversion - string - Plugin version stamp (YYYYMMDDXX).
    * img - object - Screenshot URLs keyed by file name in pix/help.
    * settingsurl - string - Settings index URL, empty for users who cannot open it.

